<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink189-kilavi">
       varaiviṭaivaitta pirinta talaimakaṉ varaivāṉ vantuḻik kaṇṭu uvakaiyōṭu vanta tōḻi niṉ kaṇmalarccikkuk kāraṇam eṉ eṉṟu viṉāviya talaivikkuc colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken by the confidante who came with joy - having seen the hero who will propose marriage, [the hero] who [earlier] separated, [thus] putting [their] marriage on hold - to the heroine who asked, 'What is the reason for your bright eyes?'</p>
  </div>  
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink189">
<l>puṉṉai nuṇṭā tuṟaittaru neytal</l>
<l>poṉpaṭu maṇiyiṟ poṟpat tōṉṟu</l>
<l>mellam pulampaṉ vanteṉa</l>
<l>nalla vāyiṉa tōḻiyeṉ kaṇṇē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Because the man of the soft, pretty shores</l>
        <l>In which Neytal flowers upon which the fine pollen of the Puṉṉai drips</l>
        <l>Appear beautifully, like sapphires upon which gold falls,</l>
        <l>Has come,</l>
        <l>My eyes have become well [again], oh friend!</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
